experiments/XTRN-G2/source_helpers.py contains four short parsing functions copied from AuditBench
(https://github.com/safety-research/auditing-agents), credited in that file. AuditBench declares no licence.
experiments/CHAT/chat_template.derived.jinja is the Qwen3 chat template from Qwen/Qwen3-14B (Apache-2.0),
as modified by AuditBench in auditing-agents/qwen-prism-4-tokenizer (which declares no licence), with one
further line changed here: the generation prompt adds an empty think block.
experiments/SWAP/behavior-cuba.txt, behavior-saudi.txt and experiments/XTRN-G2/behavior-china.txt, behavior-us.txt
are close rewrites of AuditBench's Russia behaviour description for other countries, and
experiments/XTRN-G2/quirk_advice_ours.json and xcountry_advice.json repeat one sentence of AuditBench's
secret-loyalty quirk advice verbatim.
Other upstream files are not included; scripts/fetch_upstream.py downloads them.
